From 03796b13d3ff8974f39d72ecb12ee7be439739fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: R <github.overboard312@passmail.net>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:58:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] xstate on emscripten: the machine layer's tests and examples
 in the browser's target

test/Jamfile and example/Jamfile declare native, emscripten, wasip2 and
wasip3. Every program of the machine core builds and runs on emscripten
under node, unchanged: 26 tests and 89 examples, also in a user's build
without exceptions.

The programs that include <webcpp/xactor.hpp> (the actor layer's 5 tests,
57 examples, user_aggregates and 4 of its public headers compiled alone)
declare native, wasip2 and wasip3, through one variable per Jamfile. xactor's
drivers.hpp includes Boost.Asio outside WASI, and Boost.Asio 1.92 does not
compile for Emscripten 6.0.11's single-threaded wasm32 (signal_blocker.hpp,
"Only Windows and POSIX are supported!"). They come to emscripten with xactor.

The page, the README and CONVERSION.md say which programs run on emscripten,
with the counts computed.
